+
+Non-interactive and JSON:
+
+```text
+$ openspec workset create ci-triage --member ~/src/ci --member runner=~/src/ci-runner --tool codex --json
+{
+  "workset": {
+    "name": "ci-triage",
+    "tool": "codex",
